  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Light enters from air into a given medium at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with interface of the air-medium surface. After refraction, the light ray is deviated through an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> from its original direction. The refractive index of the medium is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "uF1ip",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>732</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JgSSQ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>333</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DEJIr",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25fZB",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>732</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a73d57f8-045c-4725-beeb-ec54d9da6ddb-image.png\" style=\"width: 249px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Deviation in light ray,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></math>, here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is refracted ray.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Using Snell&#39;s law,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, the&nbsp;refractive index of the medium is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
